{"resourceIdentifier":"4557","resourceName":"Strengthening rural livelihood through carbon finance: Agroforestry practices in Bareilly Forest Circle of Uttar Pradesh","description":"The proposed ARR VCS project plans to promote sustainable agroforestry for small-scale farmers to provide them with financial benefits and ensure GHG mitigation in the state of Uttar Pradesh, India. The project is being conducted in five divisions of Bareilly Forest Circle of Uttar Pradesh, namely Bareilly Social Forestry Division. The main agroforestry tree species planted by farmers for the year are Eucalyptus, Poplar, Teak, Guava and Mango. These species have higher productivity that leads to sequestration of carbon dioxide at faster pace and ultimately reduces GHG emissions.This project will also help in increasing tree outside forest (TOF) that will add in mitigating climate change. The project shall also enhance the income of farmer communities along with biodiversity conservation and improvement of soil health.","location":{"latitude":28.347013,"longitude":79.421930},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-22","endExclusive":"2023-09-22","endInclusive":"2023-09-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4557"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh Forest Department"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18382"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3481 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/04/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 28/08/2020 - 27/08/2050"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95944&IDKEY=dq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh9132306776","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4557_06JUN2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-22T22:33:41.91Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93555&IDKEY=lkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9094129012345","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1_Bareily_21062023_s.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-07T09:55:53.383Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=148985&IDKEY=oiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfi205450315","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD 4557_13032026_Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2026-04-21T05:50:27.787Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=132805&IDKEY=kkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909k183138095","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration-Representation-VCS 4557_updated.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-06-04T06:45:37.553Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=148982&IDKEY=i0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f205446178","documentType":"Validation Report","documentNa